proceed←Warn msg;text;form;txt;ok;cancel;obj;evt
⍝ Pop up a GUI warning dialog listing msg (a vector of character-vector lines)
⍝ with Proceed/Abort buttons. Returns 1 to proceed with the build, 0 to abort.

 text←⊃{⍺,(⎕UCS 13 10),⍵}/msg,⊂'Proceed with the build?'
 form←⎕WC'Form' 'Build Warning' ('Size' 220 520)('Coord' 'Pixel')('Posn' 'Middle' 'Middle')
 txt←form.⎕WC'Text'(⊂text)(10 10)('Size' 160 500)
 ok←form.⎕WC'Button' 'Proceed' ('Posn' 180 300)('Size' 28 90)('Event' 'Select' 1)
 cancel←form.⎕WC'Button' 'Abort' ('Posn' 180 410)('Size' 28 90)('Event' 'Select' 1)
 :Repeat
     (obj evt)←2↑⎕DQ form
 :Until evt≡'Select'
 proceed←obj≡ok
